WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.390
No Smoking

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:03.390
What is it that we live for?

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:04.770
Huh?

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.220
We belong to a vicious and 
criminal secret society.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:13.490
We risk our lives for the 
sake of evil and greed.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.910
And yet...

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:16.990
Look at us now!

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.830
Uh, I'm not risking my life.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.150
We used to be shining stars.

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.680
We got to wear our 
gang emblem on our collars.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.550
Money in the right hand,
 women in the left!

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.420
Keep moving your hands, please.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:31.630
Man...

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:35.760
I didn't learn to use a knife so I could cook.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.710
Stop that, Yasu-san.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:39.140
Smoking's not allowed in here.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.220
Don't be such a drag.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.730
Check out how I handle my lighter.

00:00:58.620 --> 00:00:59.490
<b>Keep the 
bathroom 
clean!</b>

00:00:58.620 --> 00:00:59.490
<b>Always 
flush!</b>

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:23.640
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:26.350
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:28.980
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:30.650
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:31.400
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:31.730
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:32.020
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:32.690
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:07.250
Yasu! You've done it again!

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:09.790
Huh, where did Yasu-san go?

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:15.020
Poor things...

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.650
Look at them now...

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:20.920
Yasu, I'm going to make you pay!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.920
Shall I purge him?

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:23.740
You betcha!

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:25.540
Do whatever it takes to

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:28.830
track him down so we can 
torch his ass to hell!

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:31.690
Wait, what did Yasu-san do?

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:33.310
This.

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.390
Er, the cigarette?

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.780
All this just because of a cigarette?

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.650
Just because of a cigarette?

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:43.530
So you're one of <i>those</i> people?

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:45.650
No, I'm not!

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:47.640
This kitchen machine is an ancient artifact

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:52.580
that's infinitely more valuable 
and delicate than your lives.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:54.140
Got it?!

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:56.160
I got it. I got it.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:58.090
So, Goro...

00:03:58.260 --> 00:03:59.310
Yes, I'm right here.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:03.600
I believe you were in charge 
of straightening out Yasu.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.510
I'm very sorry.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:09.520
I swear to deal with Yasu, 
even if it costs me my life.

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:11.400
I'm starving.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.190
Hey, is there anything to eat?

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:14.520
The hell happened here?!

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.980
Very well, we'll forget about Yasu for now.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.070
Time to dip into the emergency war chest!

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.490
We're eating out!

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.870
<b>Chinese Food Ei Wan Ken</b>

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:36.660
Then let us thank the conquerors of 
veggies, fishies, piggies, chickens,

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:41.030
and four thousand years of 
Chinese history for this meal.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:42.510
Thank you for the meal!

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.220
Thank you for the meal!

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.310
I'm stuffed.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.110
Sorry, it okay if I have a smoke?

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:07.110
Hell no, you son of a bitch.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:12.170
How would you feel if you had to 
smell poop while you were eating?

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:15.580
Wait, there aren't any harmful 
effects from smelling poop.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:18.390
Your need for a little relaxation means that

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:21.100
every person here will have 
to inhale your toxic fumes

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:22.960
and have their lifespan reduced!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.590
Now take a good look around you!

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:28.670
Don't assume that non-smokers 
have accepted smokers.

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:34.180
Every non-smoker curses your existence 
and wishes for your death!

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:36.940
Scram!

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:40.930
You should thank your lucky 
stars that you're still alive!

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:45.390
Why?

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:48.570
Why do they keep coming back 
after I've struck them down?

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:51.030
What is that?!

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:58.560
When did they get so close?!

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:01.540
They're as hard to get 
rid of as cockroaches.

00:06:02.230 --> 00:06:03.750
Do we make our move, Kate?

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:08.510
We were going to have to 
deal with them eventually.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.750
It's time to end this!

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:31.880
We will use the full strength 
of Zvezda to crush them!

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:37.040
We will chase down every last smoker 
until they've all been wiped out!

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:39.790
Huh? What is this?

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:01.220
<b>[Source of Toxic Fumes Identified]</b>

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:28.410
Uh...

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:33.790
If you're not gonna smoke 
that, could you put it out?

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:34.720
I'm going to smoke it.

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:37.340
But if you're not going to smoke it now...

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:39.350
Zip it.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:42.010
I have a right to smoke it 
whenever I want.

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:44.270
And what's with that mask?

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.680
It's damn creepy.

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:49.360
Well, I didn't choose to wear this thing...

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:51.070
You have a right?

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:57.860
You think you have a right to 
assault every person in this city?

00:07:57.860 --> 00:07:59.870
No, I don't think so!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.990
What's this little girl talking about?

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:06.190
If I'm not supposed to smoke 
here, stop leaving ash trays.

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:08.200
If I see an ash tray, I'm gonna smoke.

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:09.560
Go ahead!

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:13.440
I'll be very generous and let you smoke 
that cigarette and many more.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:15.190
But you can never exhale!

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:17.230
Suck all that smoke into your own body!

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:19.720
Yes, yes, yes, yes.

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:22.600
A little kiddy's throwing a hissy fit.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:25.110
Yes, yes, yes, yes. I understand.

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:26.550
I understand.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:32.990
Curse you, woman,
 and your endless yapping...

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:33.990
Professor!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:34.820
Ma'am!

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:38.410
Create a device that will prevent 
smokers from exhaling toxic fumes!

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:39.950
I want it right now!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.620
I've already made one.

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:43.460
Here it is!

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:46.030
If we fire this beam,

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:52.040
any inhaled smoke will become 
part of the smoker's body.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:55.270
The exhaust is clean and harmless!

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:57.000
Good, well done!

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.910
Th-That's excessive.

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.360
You're gonna kill people.

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:01.630
They deserve to die.

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:03.770
In fact, they need to die.

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:05.660
No!

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.960
I'll agree that smokers 
may be terrible people,

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:11.590
but they're still humans.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.100
Excuse me.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.750
Thank you for telling her off.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.110
It made me feel a little better.

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:20.060
She was making trouble.

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:24.310
You know how they always get mad 
when you ask them about smoking.

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.210
That's true...

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:31.850
We were about to give up... 
They never listened to us...

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:35.670
They must have come to this 
planet from outer space.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:38.810
Your efforts may be ineffective right now,

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:41.310
but they will serve you if you never relent.

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:45.040
Fear can never inspire action!

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.600
Both in love and war!

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:50.590
If you aren't brave enough to yell 
at them, bash their head in!

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:53.450
If they refuse to listen, 
throw rocks at them!

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:56.570
If you can't do any of those 
things, curse their existence!

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:59.530
One small step can change the world!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.580
But you must be brave!

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:03.610
Yes, you're right!

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:05.570
You've given us the courage to act!

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:07.650
We will share this courage with everyone!

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:10.080
Enough enduring! It's time to protest!

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:11.710
Let them hear...

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:14.670
...our determination!

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:16.260
<i>How did this all happen?</i>

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:18.540
The time has come to take action!

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:20.750
Stand up, citizens of West Udogawa!

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:25.870
We will punish the smokers and 
run them out of this city!

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:35.030
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:35.030
<b>Episode 3              Hiding Behind Smoke and Mirrors</b>

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:39.030
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:39.030
<b>Episode 3              Hiding Behind Smoke and Mirrors</b>

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:44.990
<b>West Udogawa's Total Smoking Annihilation Campaign Has Begun!</b>

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:44.990
<i>And just like that, the battle between 
residents and smokers was underway.</i>

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.950
<b>Citywide
Smoking
Ban</b>

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:48.590
<i>The residents started off 
with a disadvantage,</i>

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:51.390
<i>but the resentment that had built over</i>

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:56.170
<i>the years proved to be much 
more explosive than anticipated.</i>

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.630
<b>Do Not Use</b>

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:58.630
<i>The tables quickly turned.</i>

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:01.270
<i>Smokers were on the retreat.</i>

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:05.720
<i>But there's no way to stop 
a mob that's tasted blood.</i>

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:10.720
<b>Extermination
of Smokers</b>

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:08.050
<i>The residents now called</i>

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:12.470
<i>themselves the Smoke Busters 
and began to hunt down Smokers.</i>

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:22.780
<i>The fighting intensified as smokers no 
longer had a refuge in West Udogawa.</i>

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:26.530
<b>Do Not
Enter</b>

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:29.890
Why is this happening?

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:45.490
You didn't skip town yet?

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:46.370
Chief!

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:49.100
Sorry, Chief...

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:52.220
You no longer have a place to call home.

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:54.160
The agency doesn't want you

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:56.820
and nobody else does, either.

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:00.050
Quit smoking, Yasu.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:01.780
I...

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.340
The world has changed.

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:06.870
I don't wanna change.

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:08.290
Yasu.

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:11.190
Why do I have to change?

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:17.000
My cigarettes were a symbol of the bad 
boy image I've painstakingly created.

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:22.830
I just wanted to work for 
evil with you again, Chief,

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.010
so why do I have to change?!

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:28.330
How come you're the only one who's changed?!

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:38.670
This way!

00:12:38.670 --> 00:12:41.040
Damn, where'd that kid go?!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:59.700
You still don't know how to use a lighter?

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:00.920
Ch-Chief!

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:03.700
And you screwed up again.

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:06.800
You're really not cut out for this work.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:08.440
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:22.440
What are you doing here?

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:27.130
Aren't you commander of the 
Musashino Shikabane Union?

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:28.320
Why would you come out here?

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:30.080
Let's go.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:34.860
You need to start by learning 
how to light a fire.

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:38.710
What happened to the old you?!

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:41.550
What is this world conquest crap?

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:45.300
Do you really think it's possible?!

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:48.120
It's not about what's possible or not.

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:49.550
We're going to do it.

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:51.890
I don't understand.

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.640
I don't get any of this!

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:56.520
Never show your face around us again.

00:13:57.020 --> 00:14:01.320
If we meet again, you will be our enemy.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:02.940
Your life won't be spared.

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:23.300
Smoke Busters!

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:34.060
Damn! What did we do to deserve this?

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:38.470
Is there nowhere left for us to go?

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:39.150
There is.

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:39.850
What?

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:40.770
<b>-They broke through! We can't run anymore... 
We'll be caught in no time.
-The Smoke Busters are too scary ><
-Three have been caught. We're done for. 
-Don't give up! 
There's something going on in the west.</b>

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.400
Well, it's just a rumor,

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.110
<b>-The Smoke Busters are too scary ><
-Three have been caught. We're done for. 
-Don't give up! 
There's something going on in the west.
-People are gathering?</b>

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:42.400
<b>-Three have been caught. We're done for. 
-Don't give up! 
There's something going on in the west.
-People are gathering?
-Where should we go?</b>

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:45.620
but I've heard that our fellow 
smokers are banding together.

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:47.570
Where are they?

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:51.740
The last fortress left to us in this city...

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.530
The Last Paradise!

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:55.490
<b>Last Paradise</b>

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.770
The rumors were true!

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:01.460
We don't have to run anymore!

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:06.170
We must fight to protect our Last Paradise!

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:15.100
<b>Rumors of the Last Paradise spread like wildfire</b>

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:19.520
<b>A showdown was inevitable</b>

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.440
<b>Zvezda has the backing of the residents 
of West Udogawa, numbering 85,000.</b>

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.060
<b>Zvezda has the backing of the residents of West Udogawa, numbering 85,000.</b>

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:28.570
<b>And the battle begins!</b>

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:28.820
<b>And the battle begins!</b>

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:29.070
<b>And the battle begins!</b>

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:29.940
<b>And the battle begins!</b>

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:37.170
This is your last warning.

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:40.380
If you drop the cigarettes and 
swear to never smoke again,

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:42.190
we will forgive your crimes

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:47.330
and allow you to live as third-class 
West Udogawa residents.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:50.670
If you continue to resist, 
we will show no mercy!

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:52.800
Screw that!

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:55.010
We've paid more in taxes than any of you!

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:56.890
The taxes on cigarettes keep increasing!

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:59.520
Is this a form of bullying? 
Prejudice at work?

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:01.990
Smoking is a gentleman's hobby!

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:03.980
You have no right to condemn us!

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:06.160
Gentleman's hobby?

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.690
That's bullshit!

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:12.780
Why is there cigarette 
smoke in shopping malls?

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:15.620
Why are there smoking areas outside offices?

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:19.010
Why must we hold our breath 
when we walk the streets?!

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:23.710
So long as there are smokers, 
there can never be peace!

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:29.590
Yes, I am not driven by a personal grudge!

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:33.770
You animals are a blemish on 
the future of this world!

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:38.470
Prepare to be crushed and 
wiped off this planet!

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:43.190
Conquest

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:44.870
time!

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:56.660
Venera's Variations in 
Persuasion failed to work?!

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:58.820
Uh, why was it supposed to work?

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:00.970
Damn. Go, Roboko!

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:02.370
Understood.

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:03.750
Purge...

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:08.790
What's wrong, Roboko?!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:09.980
Phooey!

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:11.630
The second-hand smoke is so

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:13.760
thick that Roboko's delicate 
circuits have been fried

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:15.610
and she's broken down!

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:16.500
What?!

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:20.060
What's this now? You can't do anything?

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.540
And you want to conquer the world?

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:24.270
That's a riot.

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:26.570
Hey! You have no right to talk, Yasu!

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:28.720
Do you realize who you're talking to?!

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:31.070
I'm not scared.

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:33.280
Yasu-san! Come back!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.950
We're all worried about you!

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:38.160
No, I guarantee that they're 
not worried about me.

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:39.550
Exactly!

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:41.570
I concur!

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:47.930
Yasu, are you prepared?

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:50.040
Ch-Chief...

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:55.760
I'll deal with you personally, 
as a parting gift of sorts.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:04.370
Yasu...

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:08.110
Escape through the back and 
go back from where you came.

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:09.720
What are you saying, Chief?

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:11.610
I'm coming with you!

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:14.360
The two of us are gonna make some fireworks!

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:19.740
Fool, only kids would try to 
portray death as something macho.

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:23.960
Isn't that what you're doing right now?

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:25.700
You got that right.

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:28.870
I'm not gonna die in this place.

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:32.000
I'll survive to see what comes next.

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:38.400
Ch-Chief, that's not a cigarette?

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:40.170
I quit smoking.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:43.310
Can't be a kid for the rest of my life.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:50.690
If anyone out there can kill me,

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.650
it's Hoshimiya Kate.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:30.230
Stop trying to resist 
and give yourselves up!

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:34.110
I confirm that all Zvezda 
members are present.

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:35.480
Begin the operation.

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:42.480
<b>White Light Surface-to-air Weapon of Destruction #32
Killer Magic Bullet of Black Death</b>

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:39.960
The Killer Magic Bullet of Black Death,

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:42.490
also known as the Bad Guy Bomber.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:47.230
A weapon that only rains hellfire 
upon those with evil hearts.

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:50.820
Its use is strictly prohibited 
under Tsuchimikado law.

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:53.130
We will be able to wipe out all evil.

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:56.960
I was hoping that there wouldn't 
be any civilian casualties...

00:19:57.940 --> 00:20:00.130
The battle for justice can be difficult.

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:04.330
Crap!

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:06.080
Full retreat!

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:08.080
Kid! Take the li'l lady and go!

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:09.810
Huh? What about you?!

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:12.290
Yasu and I will take care of them!

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:13.020
What?!

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:14.600
Come on, Yasu.

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:17.150
We're going to protect the li'l lady 
and the future she will bring!

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:32.790
Zvezda!

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:36.750
They got away again?

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:39.520
C-Captain! Look!

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:43.130
What's going on?

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:45.930
I could understand if honest 
citizens were unharmed,

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:49.700
but those men are driven 
by greed and desire!

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:51.400
Look closer, Captain.

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:53.140
They are no longer human.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:54.100
What?

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:59.120
I see. That's why Venera's 
persuasion didn't work.

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:04.110
Her persuasion can only work 
on those with human souls.

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:11.480
<i>And that was the end of the West 
Udogawa Smoking Ban Incident</i>

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:16.620
<i>which left a lasting mark 
in West Udogawa history.</i>

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:20.800
<i>After that, life was back to normal.</i>

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:25.590
<i>And as for Yasu-san,</i>

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:29.640
<i>he's still slacking.</i>

00:21:43.430 --> 00:21:46.640
If you need something in 
your mouth, suck on this.

00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:50.450
Th-Thank you very much...

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:12.220
<b>Smokers</b>

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:12.470
<b>Conquered</b>

00:22:12.220 --> 00:22:12.470
<b>Smokers.</b>

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:12.720
<b>Smokers..</b>

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:13.220
<b>Smokers...</b>

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:13.310
<b>Smokers...not</b>

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:15.060
<b>Smokers...not quite</b>

00:23:45.390 --> 00:23:46.910
Zvezda?

00:23:46.910 --> 00:23:48.490
Yes, Zvezda.

00:23:48.480 --> 00:23:54.570
<b>Top Secret Document
Report on the Secret Society Zvezda</b>

00:23:48.480 --> 00:23:54.570
<b>Top Secret</b>

00:23:49.510 --> 00:23:54.580
I've received reports that 30% of 
West Udogawa is under their control.

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:58.560
I know. I've already taken steps.

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:02.380
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:24:00.640 --> 00:24:02.540
My name is Odin.

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:03.320
Okay?

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:04.730
I was made to sit in seedy bars.

00:24:03.320 --> 00:24:09.180
Second-hand tobacco smoke is actually 
more harmful than first-hand smoke.

00:24:05.430 --> 00:24:07.460
Every man has a past.

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:09.850
A past that he doesn't want to touch.

00:24:09.180 --> 00:24:12.160
Take the carcinogen nitrosamine.

00:24:10.400 --> 00:24:14.560
Eventually, that past can 
become as sweet as wine.

00:24:12.160 --> 00:24:16.180
First-hand smokers will 
inhale 5.7 to 43 nanograms,

00:24:15.250 --> 00:24:19.920
With a twinge of regret 
that soothes the palate.

00:24:16.180 --> 00:24:20.210
while second-hand smokers will 
inhale 680 to 823 nanograms.

00:24:20.210 --> 00:24:24.100
In the case of Quinoline, second-hand 
smoke has eleven times more!

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:27.070
If you're tired of dreaming of the 
future, you can drown in the past.

00:24:24.100 --> 00:24:27.070
We're talking 18,000 nanograms!

00:24:27.070 --> 00:24:28.850
Are you listening to me, Yasu-san?!

00:24:27.070 --> 00:24:30.060
<b>Episode 4              UDO's in the Cold Ground</b>

00:24:28.850 --> 00:24:30.170
Shove it!
